From c028a099ffde600a563f6772b3148c450f0b931d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 21:33:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add ToolStripDropDown lifecycle members
 (Show/Close/Opening/Opened)

Adds the drop-down-specific surface to the ToolStripDropDown base: the six
Show overloads, Close/Close(reason), the Opening/Opened events with their
OnXxx raisers, and the AutoClose/DropShadowEnabled/AllowTransparency/
IsAutoGenerated settings. Living on the base, they propagate to the whole
drop-down family (ContextMenuStrip, ToolStripDropDownMenu, ToolStripOverflow),
closing ~64 net48 members (7537 -> 7473).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
